## 7. How to Run

```bash
terraform init -backend-config="key=cloudfront/us-east-2/dev/terraform.tfstate"
terraform plan  -var-file=Vars/us-east-2/dev.tfvars
terraform apply -var-file=Vars/us-east-2/dev.tfvars
```

Validate: take the `distribution_domain_name` output and request a known object:
`https://<dxxxx>.cloudfront.net/<key>`. If it serves, OAC + bucket policy are correct.

